Package: causaliflower
Title: Build and Assess Causal Graphs
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("Aidan", "Moller", , "aidan.moller@adelaide.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: The causaliflower package aims to provide simple ways of working
    with causal graphs in R. It extends 'dagitty' and 'ggdag' functions to
    enable cohesive and reproducible causal analysis workflows.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/AAGI-AUS/causaliflower
